#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2251 expect=skipped domain=TA
#note "FRESH: the batch's Domains.Include reject pin (Include [TS]; once per batch, on the dominant cluster's PMDA head). #dictionaries dummy IS declared so the only skip cause is scope. TA is out of scope. The row's CURTRT|BADCODE123 shape would fire were the domain in scope, so the skip is discriminating."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset TA
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S01 | TA | 1 | CURTRT | BADCODE123
